62
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:36,400
If it is not enough and wants to get the bite into the rear axle.

63
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:41,760
Then I have put weights here that weigh 40 kg each.
So I have 120 kg on each side.

64
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:44,620
